{0}{Heya mate. The name's Shellman.}{Heya lass. The name's Shellman.}{}{}{}{}
{1}{Welcome aboard. Ya won't be needin' my services just yet.}{Welcome aboard. Ya won't be needin' my services just yet. But it's nice to see I'm not the only female in this branch.}{}{}{}{}
