{3}{Hi there, rookie. Shards is in his office, he's expecting you.}{Hi there, rookie. Shards is in his office, he's expecting you.}{}{}{}{}
{4}{What's up? Talked to Shards yet?}{What's up? Talked to Shards yet?}{}{}{}{}
{5}{How's it goin', rookie?}{How's it goin', rookie?}{}{}{}{}
