{7}{Sorry, I haven't got time to chit-chat, I've got all this gear to sort out here.}{Sorry, I haven't got time to chit-chat, I've got all this gear to sort out here.}{}{}{}{}
{8}{Don't be scared of Chief Shards, rookie. He's always like that. Shouting and stuff.}{Don't be scared of Chief Shards, rookie. He's always like that. Shouting and stuff.}{}{}{}{}
{9}{Welcome to Nodnol's finest unit, rookie. I'll be supplying ya some gear, but not in this demo.}{Welcome to Nodnol's finest unit, rookie. I'll be supplying ya some gear, but not in this demo.}{}{}{}{}
{10}{I'm Shellman, and if you even try to call me by my first name, I'll kick yer ass! Got that, rookie?}{I'm Shellman, and if you even try to call me by my first name, I'll kick yer ass! Got that, rookie?}{}{}{}{}

